    {
      "kind": "instant_insight",
      "body": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "For a list of when Tachanun is omitted, see Appendix 12:9."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "callout",
      "body": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The general custom is that women do not say Tachanun. Why? The most common explanation is that Tachanun, similar to Maariv, was originally an optional tefillah that women did not accept upon themselves."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "faq",
      "body": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "FAQ: But why? Why the differences in tefillah (and practices) between men and women? ANSWER: Very common—and complicated question! See Appendix 11."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
